    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prism Warriors DX</strong>\u00a0is the sequel to the acclaimed retro bullet hell shooter <i>Prism Indigo DX</i>. When Tokyo comes under attack from a mysterious group of evil magical girls calling themselves &quot;the Twilight Four&quot;, the Prism Warriors must band together to stop them in their tracks and uncover their true scheme before time runs out...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as the whole spectrum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/f7a0b46b0c2b7d023e90e8f84618ee56.poster.avif?t=1748900440\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/f7a0b46b0c2b7d023e90e8f84618ee56.webm?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/f7a0b46b0c2b7d023e90e8f84618ee56.mp4?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, all seven Prism Warriors are playable, each with their own unique Passive skill and rechargeable Special move. From Prism Amber's resilience, to Prism Saffron's rapid-fire assaults, to Prism Aqua's freezing abilities, you're sure to find a Prism Warrior that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new Rainbow difficulty lets you play as all seven Prism Warriors at once, cycling from one to the next each time you lose a life. Be warned, though: should all seven of them fall, you'll have to start over from the beginning...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome all-new challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/ef7d3fe6eb115cddab89187141898241.poster.avif?t=1748900440\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/ef7d3fe6eb115cddab89187141898241.webm?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/ef7d3fe6eb115cddab89187141898241.mp4?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your pursuit of the Twilight Four, you'll face dozens of brand-new Shades with increasingly intricate bullet patterns. Additionally, certain bosses will enter Desperation Phases when their health drops low enough, switching up their movements and attack patterns; pay attention to their health as well as their bullets, and try not to get caught off-guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an expanded range of &quot;White Label&quot; cheats and &quot;Black Label&quot; handicaps, and almost twice as many in-game achievements to unlock, <i>Prism Warriors DX</i> offers plenty of ways for you to challenge yourself, whether you're a newcomer to bullet hell games, or a high-score-chasing veteran.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Simulacrum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/c0258a8a425a288b94f02da7be07b005.poster.avif?t=1748900440\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/c0258a8a425a288b94f02da7be07b005.webm?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/c0258a8a425a288b94f02da7be07b005.mp4?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've beaten the main story, more challenges await in the Simulacrum: a virtual-reality training environment developed by Prism Aqua. Battle through the Boss Rush, endure the brutal 100-wave Marathon, and take on the Prism Duels: amped-up versions of <i>Prism Indigo DX</i>'s boss fights.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prism Warriors DX</strong>\u00a0is the sequel to the acclaimed retro bullet hell shooter <i>Prism Indigo DX</i>. When Tokyo comes under attack from a mysterious group of evil magical girls calling themselves &quot;the Twilight Four&quot;, the Prism Warriors must band together to stop them in their tracks and uncover their true scheme before time runs out...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as the whole spectrum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/f7a0b46b0c2b7d023e90e8f84618ee56.poster.avif?t=1748900440\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/f7a0b46b0c2b7d023e90e8f84618ee56.webm?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/f7a0b46b0c2b7d023e90e8f84618ee56.mp4?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, all seven Prism Warriors are playable, each with their own unique Passive skill and rechargeable Special move. From Prism Amber's resilience, to Prism Saffron's rapid-fire assaults, to Prism Aqua's freezing abilities, you're sure to find a Prism Warrior that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new Rainbow difficulty lets you play as all seven Prism Warriors at once, cycling from one to the next each time you lose a life. Be warned, though: should all seven of them fall, you'll have to start over from the beginning...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome all-new challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/ef7d3fe6eb115cddab89187141898241.poster.avif?t=1748900440\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/ef7d3fe6eb115cddab89187141898241.webm?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/ef7d3fe6eb115cddab89187141898241.mp4?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your pursuit of the Twilight Four, you'll face dozens of brand-new Shades with increasingly intricate bullet patterns. Additionally, certain bosses will enter Desperation Phases when their health drops low enough, switching up their movements and attack patterns; pay attention to their health as well as their bullets, and try not to get caught off-guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an expanded range of &quot;White Label&quot; cheats and &quot;Black Label&quot; handicaps, and almost twice as many in-game achievements to unlock, <i>Prism Warriors DX</i> offers plenty of ways for you to challenge yourself, whether you're a newcomer to bullet hell games, or a high-score-chasing veteran.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Simulacrum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/c0258a8a425a288b94f02da7be07b005.poster.avif?t=1748900440\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/c0258a8a425a288b94f02da7be07b005.webm?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514400/extras/c0258a8a425a288b94f02da7be07b005.mp4?t=1748900440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've beaten the main story, more challenges await in the Simulacrum: a virtual-reality training environment developed by Prism Aqua. Battle through the Boss Rush, endure the brutal 100-wave Marathon, and take on the Prism Duels: amped-up versions of <i>Prism Indigo DX</i>'s boss fights.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Prism Warriors return for another helping of retro-styled bullet hell action. Face off against the sinister Twilight Four, and fight to save more than just your friends...",
